= California University of Science and Medicine - Prompt 03

#section_label("Prompt metadata")
- Title: Working with a Difficult Person
- Limit: 150 words
- Cycle used in this repo: 2025-2026 from Admit.org / Med School Insiders
- Source: https://med.admit.org/secondary-essays/california-university-of-science-and-medicine
- Local notes file: prompt-03.local.md

#section_label("Prompt text")
Give an example of when you had to work with someone who was difficult to get along with. Why was this person difficult? How did you handle that person?

#section_label("Shared backbone files")
- typst/shared/teamwork.typ
- typst/shared/challenge.typ

#section_label("teamwork backbone")
= Teamwork Backbone

== Team Situation
Pick a team-based example with visible interdependence.

== Your Role
- What role did you play?
- What role did others play?
- How did you adjust?

== Outcome
Show what good teamwork required from you.
#section_label("challenge backbone")
= Challenge / Adversity Backbone

== Situation
Describe the challenge clearly and briefly.

== Response
- What did you do?
- What tradeoffs or hard decisions did you make?
- Who did you rely on?

== Growth
- What changed in you?
- How will this matter in medicine?

